title: The Strikers Reject the Settlement
subtitle: PPS accepted a settlement, but part of the strikers will not end the action.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_union_rules && PolishUnions.rejectionDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event society.strike_settlement_rejection, E6 (technical reference 14.5, 17.15; card catalogue 9.9; Z — 0.38): only
// after a real settlement accepted by PPS and a real refusal; one instance per strike and settlement, 0 T, two answers,
// no renegotiation. The answer does not settle the signature again.
PolishUnions.rejectionView(Q);
!}

= The strikers reject the settlement

[+ pl_rej_text +]

- @uphold
- @support

@uphold
title: Uphold the settlement and call for the end of the strike
subtitle: The obligation stands; part of the strikers may go on without PPS, and the branches that refused have the end imposed (dissent +10, trust −8).
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.rejectionChoose(Q, 'uphold');
!}
go-to: result

@support
title: Support the further strike
subtitle: The mobilisation and its costs go on, and PPS breaks the settlement it accepted (credibility −5). It forces no better offer.
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.rejectionChoose(Q, 'support');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= The strikers reject the settlement

[+ pl_union_result +]

- @root: Continue.
